{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/3/1839143931702de803711194cfe61d74baed5b5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^x = 32$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/c/1fc927693dde0c7071071123969c057bbb6ffc71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{3} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{3}{2} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{3}{5} \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"363\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recognizing that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/8601f0bc6d9343ee52402fb2edfe0cd0eb47eadc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8=2^3$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a79fe67304f235d8c51facfa39a34b430450723.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3x}=32$\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a41b738c2ff69ccfd120a11701fa802704e2439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^5=32$\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/1/4311b91ab7fa445140b809212a5b2e45d12092cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3x}=2^5$\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54f978b08d595410ffac01657e4ff88e8dd51ba7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\dfrac{5}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>So our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c61bf825429a0c2ce4c947d8d99ff717f30b899.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"58\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1962 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1962\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>Problem 3</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td